# Analysis > Electronic Structure > Electronic Post-Processing on the golden
# CHGCAR (total and magnetization, 8 x 8 x 6): each tool group's
# calculations (values from the C++ electronic golden tests), an isosurface,
# the 2D section's contours, every export format, workspaces and undo.
dialog electronic open
dialog electronic try load rust/tests/fixtures/electronic/missing.cube
dialog electronic expect-error Cannot open volumetric file
dialog electronic load rust/tests/fixtures/electronic/CHGCAR
dialog electronic expect-fields 2
dialog electronic expect-field-name total
# General analysis.
dialog electronic tool Total integral
dialog electronic calculate
dialog electronic expect-heading integral (field unit * A^3)
dialog electronic expect-table 0 0 7.950156025574981
dialog electronic tool Planar average
dialog electronic set axis 2
dialog electronic calculate
dialog electronic expect-table 0 1 0.04734661122731993
dialog electronic expect-table 1 0 0.5833333333333333
dialog electronic tool Peak search
dialog electronic calculate
dialog electronic expect-rows 2
dialog electronic expect-table 0 3 2.641580223721805
dialog electronic expect-table 1 3 1.2554429696109024
dialog electronic tool Structure factors
dialog electronic set reflections 0 0 0; 1 0 0
dialog electronic calculate
dialog electronic expect-table 0 3 7.950156025574978
dialog electronic expect-table 1 3 2.500391111496908
dialog electronic expect-table 1 4 1.8165399895192365
dialog electronic tool Laplacian
dialog electronic calculate
dialog electronic expect-fields 3
dialog electronic expect-field-name Laplacian
# Charge transfer: field 1 is the magnetization (a signed density).
dialog electronic field 1
dialog electronic tool Charge summary
dialog electronic calculate
dialog electronic expect-table 0 0 3.445232117995002
dialog electronic expect-table 0 2 0.13926699107888185
dialog electronic field 0
dialog electronic tool Cumulative profile
dialog electronic calculate
dialog electronic expect-heading distance_A,cumulative_e
dialog electronic expect-table 1 1 0.4198066195489034
dialog electronic tool Threshold mask
dialog electronic set mask-low 0.5
dialog electronic set mask-high 3
dialog electronic calculate
dialog electronic expect-fields 4
dialog electronic expect-field-name threshold_mask
dialog electronic tool Total integral
dialog electronic calculate
dialog electronic expect-history 10
dialog electronic undo
dialog electronic expect-history 9
dialog electronic redo
dialog electronic expect-history 10
# Bonding and topology.
dialog electronic field 0
dialog electronic tool Bader partition
dialog electronic calculate
dialog electronic expect-fields 5
dialog electronic expect-rows 2
dialog electronic expect-table 0 1 6.263067180975238
dialog electronic expect-table 1 2 17.31770833333333
dialog electronic field 1
dialog electronic tool Bader partition
dialog electronic try calculate
dialog electronic expect-error requires nonnegative density
# An isosurface of the total density and the 2D section.
dialog electronic field 0
dialog electronic expect-range 0.010045085 2.641580223721805
dialog electronic surface 0.5
dialog electronic expect-triangles 50
dialog electronic contour on 0.5
dialog electronic expect-contours 4
dialog electronic slice-arbitrary 0.5 0.5 0.5 1 1 1
dialog electronic contour on 0.5
dialog electronic expect-contours 4
# Exports.
dialog electronic export rust/target/ui/electronic.xsf
dialog electronic export rust/target/ui/electronic.cube
dialog electronic export rust/target/ui/electronic.vasp
dialog electronic export rust/target/ui/electronic.obj
dialog electronic export rust/target/ui/electronic.ply
dialog electronic export rust/target/ui/electronic_section.svg
dialog electronic set render volume
dialog electronic export rust/target/ui/electronic_volume.png
dialog electronic set render surface
dialog electronic export rust/target/ui/electronic_surface.png
dialog electronic tool Planar average
dialog electronic calculate
dialog electronic export rust/target/ui/electronic_planar.csv
dialog electronic save-workspace rust/target/ui/electronic.afproject
dialog electronic clear
dialog electronic expect-fields 0
dialog electronic open-workspace rust/target/ui/electronic.afproject
dialog electronic expect-fields 5
dialog electronic expect-rows 6
dialog electronic expect-triangles 50
dialog electronic slice 2 0.5
dialog electronic set render volume
wait 3
screenshot rust/target/ui/electronic.png
dialog electronic set render surface
wait 3
screenshot rust/target/ui/electronic_surface_view.png
quit
